    "title": "Costco project near Enka/Candler gets new hearing date - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dee Pridgen ,\n16 hours ago ASHEVILLE, N.C. (828newsNOW) — A long-anticipated Costco store planned for the Enka-Candler area is one step closer to becoming reality. The proposed 160,940-square-foot warehouse — featuring a 32-pump fueling station and tire center — is scheduled to go before the Asheville Technical Review Committee on Nov. 17. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 5",
